    "body": "fix on issue/1735-open-edge-band · PR #1769 · pinned by open_band::two_open_slot_edges_cut_the_band_up_to_the_stock_edge, open_band::the_extension_moves_the_open_ends_out_of_the_stock_along_the_walls, open_band::a_selection_with_no_clear_band_is_refused_by_name, open_band::a_band_pass_that_cuts_another_part_blocks_the_post · merges when reviewed\n\nThe PR does not duplicate draft PR #1756. That PR changes the open boundary path. This PR changes the source selection path. A trial merge of the two heads with `git merge-tree` gives no conflict. Follow-up issues: #1762 and #1763.",
